[
    ["mainTitle", "Strong Adjectives"],
    ["text","<div>Adjectives are strong, when it describes smth. none specified (a tree) or if the verb 'vera' (to be) is used, it is a weak one if the described word is specified (the tree).</div>"],
    ["text","<div>Strong Adjectives need to be adjusted to the describes word in case, number and gender -> 24 diffrent variants.</div>"],
    
    ["container", [
        ["title", "Genders and Cases"],
        ["title", "Genders:"],
        ["text", "<ul><li>Neuter, (typical) ending -_ and a 'a'</li><li> Feminin, (typical) ending -_ and a 'ǫ'</li><li> Masculine, (typical) ending -r </li></ul>"],
        ["title", "Cases:"],
        ["table", [
            [false,{"text":"<b>explanation</b>","color":"gray"},{"text":"<b>example</b>","color":"gray"}],
            [{"text":"<b>Nominative</b>","color":"gray"},{"text":"Who/what is (verb)ing?","color":"transparent"},{"text":"<b>I</b> gave Terry's clinic a donation","color":"transparent"}],
            [{"text":"<b>Accusative</b>","color":"gray"},{"text":"Who/what did (the subject) (verb)?","color":"transparent"},{"text":"I gave Terry's clinic a <b>donation</b>","color":"transparent"}],
            [{"text":"<b>Genitive</b>","color":"gray"},{"text":"Whose?","color":"transparent"},{"text":"I gave <b>Terry's</b> clinic a donation","color":"transparent"}],
            [{"text":"<b>Dative</b>","color":"gray"},{"text":"To who/what?","color":"transparent"},{"text":"I gave Terry's <b>clinic</b> a donation","color":"transparent"}]
